      "body": "Simpler repro:\n```\nimport functools\n\ndef capture(*args, **kw):\n    return (args, kw)\ndef extract_sig(part):\n    return (part.func, part.args, part.keywords, part.__dict__)\n\nf = functools.partial(extract_sig)\nf.__setstate__((capture, (1,), {}, ()))\nf.__setstate__((capture, (1,), {}, {}))\n```\n\nThe problem is in the last argument of the tuple that passed to `__setstate__`. It should be a dict, but the inner checks passed incorrectly for some reason.\n\nI will take a look.",
